<title>FINLAND: NESTE FINED FIM 2 MLN IN SEO CASE - WATCHDOG.</title>
<headline>NESTE FINED FIM 2 MLN IN SEO CASE - WATCHDOG.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Finnish Board of Competition set a two million markka fine for Finnish oil and energy group Neste Oy for breaking competition rules, the board said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Neste had misused its dominating market position in wholesale pricing to rival retailer Suomalainen Energiaosuuskunta (SEO), it said.  </p>
<p>The Office for Free Competition had proposed a 100 million markka fine but the board said Neste used illegal pricing only during a short period in 1993 and that it did not cause any major financial damage to SEO on an annual basis.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358 - 9 - 680 50 242</p>
